  m_Text: "Testing Steps:\r\n  1. <b><size=50>Grab method</size></b>: Approach the
    object according to the direction of arrow and grab it by fist.\r\n  2. <b><size=50>Grab
    gesture</size></b>: When grabbing an object, the hand should keep a specific
    grab gesture, with the exception of the required fingers, all other fingers can
    bend freely.\r\n  3. <b><size=50>Multiple gestures</size></b>: The mug can be
    held by its top, body and handle.\r"
